    "\n",
    "    -   $s=\\operatorname{syt}\\left(a,\\,b\\right)$ ja\n",
    "\n",
    "    -   $x$:lle ja $y$:lle pätee $ax+by=\\operatorname{syt}\\left(a,\\,b\\right)$"
   ]
  }
